From: Gli_acopo <82150202+GliAcopo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 21:33:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] text: section numbers in the section navigator

The navigator shows the number of each section, as in the document (option
"Numbers", on by default). The numbers are computed with the rules of
new-section: all sections count, also those inside environments, which
the navigator does not list. They are recomputed when the listed sections
change, and at most every 10 seconds otherwise.
---
